<!--
  Imported clips live under Resources/Audio. Every row keeps synth parameters as a playable fallback:
  a missing or corrupt delivery must reduce fidelity rather than prevent a run from starting.

  High-frequency keys own both a time throttle and a concurrency cap. The former stops one-frame
  bursts, the latter stops long tails from accumulating into a noise wall.
-->
